---
import InfoPage from '../components/InfoPage.astro';
---
<InfoPage title="Contact" description="Find out how to contact Karinderya Wiki about corrections, feedback, and site questions." relatedLinks={[{ label: 'Guides', href: '/guides/' }, { label: 'About', href: '/about/' }, { label: 'Privacy Policy', href: '/privacy-policy/' }]}>
  <h2>Corrections and feedback</h2>
  <p>We welcome reliable corrections and suggestions, especially when they include an official source or enough detail to reproduce an in-game result.</p>
  <p class="notice">No public site contact address is currently published. Check this page for a future contact channel; this unofficial wiki will not invent contact details.</p>
  <h2>Before sending game data</h2>
  <p>Please include the page involved, the exact detail that needs changing, and where the corrected information can be confirmed. Do not send passwords, account credentials, or other sensitive information.</p>
</InfoPage>
